melonDS DS on GLES 3.2: lets the GL renderer build against GLES3 (with patches/melonds.patch on the melonDS
dependency), requests a GLES 3.2 context, ports the compositor shaders to GLSL ES 3.00, and turns face culling off
around the screen blit. Also carries JesseTG/melonds-ds#335 (video views: the frontend lays the screens out). Applied to cores/src/melondsds.

Local wireless: tells the frontend when the emulated radio is on, off or hosting (nx_nds_radio.h), writes the firmware dump back with its own MAC and nickname, and waits for multiplayer replies by wall clock, counting blank replies by sender like standalone melonDS.
